# (build 138d) After a damage floor's white field the palette comes back as
# the level loaded it. loc_7108 (ps2.asm:10430) sets every live entry to
# $EEE for one field, then loc_7140 copies the fade target ($FFFFFB80, the
# palette as loaded) back over it and waits seven more fields: the
# cycling entries show their loaded colours until loc_6430 next writes
# them. Here Gaira's line 2 entry 14, loaded $44E (level_gaira.png), which
# its pulse (loc_65D8) has at $004 when the step lands. Until 138d the port put back the
# palette as it was shown before the field. Gaira's damage floor at cell
# 3,6, from the open cell above it. Fails on 138c.

start level $41 3 5
wait idle
wait ticks 30                # the cycles step away from the loaded colours
walk down 1
wait ticks 16
expect pixel 160 112 $EEE    # the white field
wait ticks 1
expect pixel 44 36 $44E      # loc_7140: the loaded colour (before 138d $004)
wait ticks 9
expect pixel 44 36 $008      # loc_6430's next step writes it again
